WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.363
How many centimetres are in 1 metres? Let us think carefully. Multiply metres by 100

00:00:06.363 --> 00:00:11.293
because 1 m equals 100 cm. The answer is 100. Great work!

